title: Text editor
description: Pages (BlockNote). Headings, lists, code, pictures and videos, and a card that links another document. Carets and selections of other people show live.
color: teal
connects:
  - to: src/lib/sync
    label: Yjs collaboration
    description: BlockNote edits a Yjs XmlFragment. The sync provider carries its updates and the awareness protocol (carets and selections) over the document's Realtime channel.
